        {
          "title": "My latest industry survey indicates Google has cut 2027 shipments of the Broadcom-designed TPU 8i series by ~1M units (mostly the higher-priced 8i Max / Whalefish). The cut amounts to roughly 20% of 2027 TPU 8i series shipments. The survey also indicates Google plans to increase 2027 shipments of the MediaTek-designed TPU 8t series, though details aren't final yet. Google has repeatedly stressed in recent months that frontier model development gets first call on compute, and this shift in the 8t and 8i shipment mix is precisely the adjustment it's making amid a tight supply chain and data center power constraints.",
          "url": "https://x.com/mingchikuo/status/2123792271195918462?s=20",
          "time": "2026-11-20 22:55",
          "source_name": "郭明錤"
        },
        {
          "title": "我最新的產業調查顯示，Google 下修 2027 年、由 Broadcom 設計的 TPU 8i 系列共約 100 萬顆（以單價較高的 8i Max / Whalefish 為主）。此下修約佔 2027 年 TPU 8i 系列出貨量約 20%。 本次調查也指出，Google 預計增加 2027 年由聯發科設計的 TPU 8t 系列出貨，但細節尚未確定。Google 近幾個月反覆強調前沿模型研發優先取得算力，此次 8t 與 8i 系列出貨比重的改變，正是在供應鏈緊張與資料中心供電受限下所做的調整。",
          "url": "https://x.com/mingchikuo/status/2123792257379938758?s=20",
          "time": "2026-11-20 22:55",
          "source_name": "郭明錤"
        }
